        <item>
            <title>2.2.1</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 13 Jul 2026 12:45:47 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>20260713</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New in v2.2.1</h2>
                <h3>Enhancements</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Posters
                        <ul>
                            <li>Posters now have some additional configuration options to customize the experience for use cases such as YouTube thumbnails.</li>
                            <li>Updated the context menu Show in Finder menu to include jumping straight to the recording OR poster to easily find either.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Bugfixes</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>When marking the result of a game that was previously unknown the poster wasn't updating to reflect the now known Victory or Defeat outcome, the posters now update after selecting a matchup outcome.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>For the full detailed changelog please visit <a href="https://fireflymac.gg/changelog.html">https://fireflymac.gg/changelog.html</a>.</p>
            ]]></description>
